      "note": [
        "Tables regarding the reporting years 2004-2008 are separate from the reporting years 2010-2012. The reason is that several parameters changed between reporting years 2008 and 2010, which means that statistics from 2008 and earlier are not directly comparable with later statistics. It is therefore not possible to compare time series over the period 2004-2016.",
        "The meaning of (..) is that data cannot occur or is removed for reasons of confidentiality. Examples for data that will not occur could be that certain types of waste is never treated through composting or digestion or that certain types of waste is always classified as hazardous and hence cannot occur as non-hazardous waste. \r\n  The figure zero (0) means that the value has been rounded down to zero, or is zero. \r\n  Methodologies to produce the statistics differ between economical activities. In the cases data is reused from previous year the values may be the same over the years."
